{"login": "AkstonCap", "location": null, "commits": [{"sha": "47ffcd89b63116ee316637eab7016abb6c6962bc", "message": "Merge pull request #18 from AkstonCap/claude/add-nft-trading-feature-mmFOt\n\nAdd NFT Art marketplace for trading tokenized digital art", "created_at": "2026-03-04T11:43:25Z", "repo": "DEX", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "869a7473f2902d36af961bb84333e42c3edfd5da", "message": "Add summary for remaining holders in HoldersList\n\nIntroduces a summary section below the holders table that displays the count, total held, and percentage of supply for holders not shown in the main list. This provides additional context for the distribution of tokens among all holders beyond the top N displayed.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T17:39:02Z", "repo": "DEX", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1aae6736fe148264a5bae3e360dc721d115c280b", "message": "Update TradeForm.js", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:23:51Z", "repo": "DEX", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "237f214768030c2b54dbc863f22a7646cf977ee1", "message": "Update placeOrder.js", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:23:45Z", "repo": "DEX", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "97b00e428bbc1528f215546e5d02229a670ae8b7", "message": "Add market fill order execution to TradeForm\n\nIntroduces a 'Market Fill' order method in the TradeForm, allowing users to automatically find and execute the best available order within a specified maximum payment amount. Implements price protection, confirmation dialogs, and updates account selection logic to support the new order type. Also updates button styling for the new market fill option and fixes account validation logic in order placement.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:06:50Z", "repo": "DEX", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2d86ca7c0a7d9eb1602e5163df370daee52de633", "